# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository, on every platform.
#
# Without this the tracker snapshots flip-flop forever: csv.writer emits CRLF
# regardless of platform, Windows core.autocrlf=true rewrites it to LF on
# commit, and the Linux CI runner does not - so a scheduled refresh and a local
# refresh each "change" all 102 rows by rewriting the other's line endings.
# With three scheduled runs a weekday that is three empty commits a day.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
